# playGo SDD Rules

Read `AGENTS.md` first. This repository uses Spec-Driven Development.

- Before changing behavior, create or update `specs/NNN-*.md` with observable behavior and testable acceptance criteria.
- Update `shared/protocol.ts` and `docs/PROTOCOL.md` when messages change.
- Game rules belong in `server/`; the client only renders and sends intents.
- Validate external input with zod; never trust client fields.
- Keep private data per-player (words, hands, photos).
- Add tests in `tests/*.test.ts`; protocol smoke in `scripts/smoke.mjs`; UI in `e2e/run.mjs`.
- Run `pnpm verify`; run `pnpm smoke` when the protocol changes.
- Do not edit `dist/`, `release/`, `electron/app/`, or commit secrets.
